note [10_python_library.enppl: The Python Library in E++]

add the "Python" library

note [1. Run single-line Python code:]
run the python code "print('Hello from Python single line!')"

note [2. Run multi-line Python block:]
run the python code:
for I in range 3:
   print("Hello from Python loop:", I)

note [3. Interacting between E++ and Python:]
let 'Greeting' be "Welcome to E++ and Python"
run the python code "print('Uppercase:', greeting.upper())"
